#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its copy of the token but cannot revoke it in Front. Delete the token in Settings › Developers › API tokens; Yuva does not need it any more."
msgstr "Yuva smazala svou kopii tokenu, ale nemůže ho ve Frontu zneplatnit. Smažte token v Settings › Developers › API tokens; Yuva ho už nepotřebuje."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its key but cannot reset it in Freshdesk. Open Profile settings and choose Reset API key; Yuva does not need it any more."
msgstr "Yuva svůj klíč smazala, ale ve Freshdesku ho nemůže obnovit. Otevřete Profile settings a zvolte Reset API key; Yuva ho už nepotřebuje."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token {deletedAt} and can no longer read {provider}."
msgstr "Yuva smazala svůj token {deletedAt} a už nemůže číst {provider}."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token and can no longer read {provider}."
msgstr "Yuva smazala svůj token a už nemůže číst {provider}."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it at Microsoft. In your Microsoft account, open Privacy › Apps and services, choose Yuva and remove its permissions."
msgstr "Yuva smazala svůj token, ale nemůže ho u Microsoftu zrušit. Ve svém účtu Microsoft otevřete Privacy › Apps and services, vyberte Yuvu a odeberte její oprávnění."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it at Microsoft. Remove Yuva from your work account in My Apps; an admin removes it for everyone in the Microsoft Entra admin center › Enterprise applications."
msgstr "Yuva smazala svůj token, ale nemůže ho u Microsoftu zrušit. Odeberte Yuvu ze svého pracovního účtu v My Apps; správce ji odebere všem v Microsoft Entra admin center › Enterprise applications."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it in Crisp. Regenerate the token in Settings › Workspace Settings › Advanced configuration; Yuva does not need it any more."
msgstr "Yuva svůj token smazala, ale nemůže ho v Crispu zrušit. Vygenerujte token znovu v Settings › Workspace Settings › Advanced configuration; Yuva ho už nepotřebuje."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it in Help Scout. Delete the app in Your Profile › My Apps; Yuva does not need it any more."
msgstr "Yuva smazala svůj token, ale nemůže ho zrušit v Help Scout. Smažte aplikaci v Your Profile › My Apps; Yuva ji už nepotřebuje."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it in Zendesk. Delete the client in Admin Center › Apps and integrations › APIs › OAuth clients; Yuva does not need it any more."
msgstr "Yuva smazala svůj token, ale nemůže ho zrušit v Zendesk. Smažte klienta v Admin Center › Apps and integrations › APIs › OAuth clients; Yuva ho už nepotřebuje."

#: src/features/migrations/SignInConnectStep.tsx
#: src/features/migrations/TokenConnectStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deletes its token when the migration ends."
msgstr "Yuva smaže svůj token, když migrace skončí."

